From 8f35b3c736325213530f37100d50cb154bcdcdd2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aurora-StFM <scp.173.x@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 10:04:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ucm2: Nothing: spacewar: link profile for the sm7325 card
 driver

Newer kernels describe the Nothing Phone (1) sound card as
"nothing,spacewar-sndcard", which the sm8250 machine driver reports
with driver name "sm7325". Link the profile under conf.d/sm7325 too, so
it is found with both the old and the new compatible.

Co-developed-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Aurora-StFM <scp.173.x@gmail.com>
---
 ucm2/conf.d/sm7325/NP1.conf | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
 create mode 120000 ucm2/conf.d/sm7325/NP1.conf

diff --git a/ucm2/conf.d/sm7325/NP1.conf b/ucm2/conf.d/sm7325/NP1.conf
new file mode 120000
index 0000000..8f3351b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/ucm2/conf.d/sm7325/NP1.conf
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+../../Nothing/spacewar/NP1.conf
\ No newline at end of file
-- 
2.43.0

